# Tile drawing flow: erase → pick tile → paint; right-drag erases; shift+arrows draw
size 120 40
spawn
wait "Welcome" 10s
keys esc
wait idle
# paint a row of ▓ with the mouse (pick glyph 3 from the sidebar bar)
click 100 21
drag 2 3 30 3
# switch to the eraser, erase part of it
keys e
drag 10 3 15 3
# click a tile in the bar: must come back to the brush and paint
click 102 21
wait "brush '█'"
drag 2 5 30 5
# right-drag erases without switching tools
mouse down right 20 5
mouse drag right 25 5
mouse up right 25 5
# keyboard pen: shift+arrows draw a trail with the current tile
keys 4
keys shift-down shift-down shift-down shift-right shift-right shift-right
wait idle
shot tile_flow
expect "▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓"
expect "Brush"
